Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeIntersectionWithFog" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:evidence1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Fog reduces visibility of actors and obstacles" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Wet road conditions due to fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Streetlights and billboards may distract driver" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.7"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.5"^^xsd:float .

:trafficLight1 a :TrafficLight ;
    :description "Red traffic light at intersection" .

:billboard1 a :Billboard ;
    :description "Billboard with advertisement on left side" .
```

---

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Fog reduces visibility of actors and obstacles
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Wet road conditions due to fog
Severity Score: 0.7

**Risk 3:**
Description: Streetlights and billboards may distract driver
Severity Score: 0.5

---
The scene is classified as an **EvidenceBasedAnomaly** due to the foggy conditions acting as an evidence indicator (FallingObjectIndicator, though loosely interpreted here as reduced visibility). The identified risks include **OcclusionRisk**, **RoadConditionRisk**, and **DistractionRisk**. The severity scores reflect the potential danger of each risk in this foggy nighttime scenario.